{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.H4RouteBBranchingPrune","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.H4RouteBBranchingPrune","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.branchToH4_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.branchToH4_injective","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/H4RouteBBranchingPrune.lean#L67-L75","doc":"**H₃ data is the independent content.** The `λ ⊢ 3` readings are recovered from\nthe `λ ⊢ 4` readings (`a = χ₍₄₎`, `b = χ₍₂,₂₎`, `c = χ₍₁,₁,₁,₁₎`), so `branchToH4`\nis injective: it adds no information beyond the three H₃ numbers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.branchToH4_two_relations","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.branchToH4_two_relations","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/H4RouteBBranchingPrune.lean#L58-L65","doc":"**Route-B prune (no independent N=4 rung).** The five `λ ⊢ 4` block readings of\nany element of `H₃ ⊂ H₄` satisfy two fixed branching relations, so they are\ndetermined by the three `λ ⊢ 3` readings — re-decomposing the unchanged H₃\nelement at `λ ⊢ 4` cannot produce a genuine `c₄^even` rung. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.branchToH4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.branchToH4","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/H4RouteBBranchingPrune.lean#L53-L56","doc":"The five `λ ⊢ 4` block readings of an element of `H₃ ⊂ H₄`, as functions of its\nthree `λ ⊢ 3` readings `(a, b, c) = (χ₍₃₎, χ₍₂,₁₎, χ₍₁,₁,₁₎)`, by the branching\nrule `S₄ ↓ S₃`. Order: `(χ₍₄₎, χ₍₃,₁₎, χ₍₂,₂₎, χ₍₂,₁,₁₎, χ₍₁,₁,₁,₁₎)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}